+	help
+	  ALi C3503D SoC (M36F family) as used in the Ferguson Ariva 54
+	  and similar DVB set-top boxes.  Single MIPS 4K-family core
+	  (PRId 0x18055, MIPS32 release 1, fixed-mapping MMU: Config0.MT=3,
+	  no TLB), 16 KiB I/D caches, CP0 Count/Compare timer, 128 MiB DDR
